{"kind": "mod", "id": 2602, "name": "22 Crackshot", "slug": "22-crackshot", "teaser": "Quite possibly the worst gun mod out there.", "owner_name": "Dar'Zhar", "downloads": 798, "favourites": 3, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.darzhar.crackshot22", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Weapons", "category_id": 13, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:05:52.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-02-22T18:52:48.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-02-22T12:54:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.12", "latest_version": "1.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Disclaimer</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod is not to be taken seriously</p>\n<p>22 Crackshot is the wretched mind child of me seeing a drug bust gun that was made from a flare pistol and thinking “that’d be funny in tarkov”\nand now we have this..<br />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RpQFgcpv/22crackshot.png\" alt=\"22CrackshotGun\" title=\"22CrackshotGun\" /></p>\n<p>The gun and ammunition can be purchased from Skier.</p>\n<p>Huge shoutout to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/36153/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EpicRangeTime</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/30890/grooveypenguinx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveyPengiunX</a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/33775/bushtail\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bushtail</a>. This mod would have taken ALOT longer without their generous assistance.</p>\n<p>Another thank you to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/84418/bobinstien\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bobinstein</a> for their .22 models that i used for refs.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Inspiration</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/S4kr2Kf0/inspo1.png\" alt=\"LOS BANOS, California - Tweaker Gun\" title=\"LOS BANOS, California - Tweaker Gun\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9mMwpCPN/inspo3.png\" alt=\"22 SUPER long“\" title=\"22 SUPER long\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p6N8vxS3/inspo2.png\" alt=\"22Spear\" title=\"22Spear\" />\nI do not remember what video the 22spear is from. image was sent by a friend.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Demonstration Video</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"l-gB_NO9lOU\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/l-gB_NO9lOU?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l-gB_NO9lOU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.12", "content_length": 15906626, "downloads": 798, "published_at": "2026-02-22T18:54:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2602/22-crackshot/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib"}]}], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/logarbLord/22Crackshot", "label": ""}]}